      <section class="sec-section" id="faqs">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p>Answers to common banking questions.</p></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-list">
          <article class="faq-item searchable-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">
              <span>How do I reset my online banking password?</span><span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-1">
              Select the profile or sign-in assistance option and follow the available account recovery instructions. You may need to verify your identity before creating a new password. Never share your password or verification codes.
              <br><br><a href="/profile">Visit your profile →</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="faq-item searchable-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">
              <span>What are my transfer limits?</span><span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-2">
              Limits may depend on your account type, transfer method, security settings, and applicable bank policies. Review the limits shown for your account or contact the bank through a verified support channel.
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="faq-item searchable-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">
              <span>How do I access my bank statements?</span><span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-3">
              Sign in and open the relevant account section. Look for statements, documents, or account activity. If you cannot find the statement you need, contact support.
              <br><br><a href="/accounts">View accounts →</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="faq-item searchable-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">
              <span>Why is my wire transfer delayed?</span><span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-4">
              Transfers may be delayed because of processing schedules, bank holidays, intermediary banks, security reviews, or incorrect recipient details. Contact support with your transaction reference. Do not send a duplicate transfer until the original status has been confirmed.
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="faq-item searchable-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">
              <span>Can I cancel or reverse a payment?</span><span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-5">
              This depends on the payment method and transaction status. Contact the bank as soon as possible. Completed transfers may not be reversible, and recovery is not guaranteed.
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="faq-item searchable-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-6">
              <span>How do I identify phishing messages?</span><span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-6">
              Be alert to unsolicited messages requesting urgent action, passwords, PINs, or verification codes. Avoid clicking suspicious links or opening unexpected attachments. Always verify unusual communications through AgriBank Texas's official contact channels.
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="faq-item searchable-item">
            <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-7">
              <span>What should I do if my card is lost or stolen?</span><span class="faq-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer" id="faq-answer-7">
              Contact the bank immediately through a verified channel and ask about blocking or freezing the card. Review recent transactions and report anything you do not recognize.
              <br><br><a href="#contact">Contact support →</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
